	"name": "Armored Leg Braces",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/equipment/leg/pants-armored-tasset-steel.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Built primarily to support people with skeletal or muscular issues in their legs, ankles, or hips, these braces have been heavily reinforced to increase their resilience not only as mobility devices, but also as capable protection of the lower extremities.</p><p>While wearing armored leg braces, you are able to ignore up to 10ft of reduced movement speed from spells, effects, or medical issues. You also gain a +1 bonus to AC if wearing light or no armor.</p>",
